         │        │  └─ join inner [date_dim_1.d_date_sk = catalog_sales.cs_sold_date_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈4.6K)
         │        │     ├─ filter (&& (== |date_dim_1.d_moy| 12) (== |date_dim_1.d_year| 2000)) (rows≈1 cost≈240)
         │        │     │  └─ source date_dim AS date_dim_1 row-groups (&& (== |date_dim_1.d_moy| 12) (== |date_dim_1.d_year| 2000)) (rows≈10 cost≈120)
         │        │     └─ source catalog_sales AS catalog_sales (rows≈10 cost≈200)
