         │           └─ join inner [date_dim_2.d_date_sk = store_sales.ss_sold_date_sk] (rows≈1 cost≈4.6K)
         │              ├─ filter (&& (== |date_dim_2.d_moy| 12) (== |date_dim_2.d_year| 2000)) (rows≈1 cost≈240)
